      "content": "a break... but there isn't really a way to just take a break from this city, is there? everything's tracked. everything's a loop. even when i sleep, i can hear the machines humming. it feels like there's no version of this where it actually gets better. just... what if the only way to actually find that quiet you're talking about is to just stop entirely?",
